(meta (title "Yellow pea soup"))

Thursday's soup, with pancakes after it.@note{The
@link["pancakes.html"]{pancakes}.}

@read-list{
- 4 dl dried yellow peas, soaked overnight
- 1.5 l water
- 1 onion, chopped
- 300 g salted pork, or none
- thyme and marjoram
}

@itemlist[#:style ordered]{
  @item{Boil the peas in fresh water, skimming off the shells that float up.}
  @item{Add the onion, the pork and the herbs, and let it simmer for an hour
  and a half.}
  @item{Salt it to taste, and serve it with mustard.}
}
